le, not built for 1904: see the material item.; openings: the engraving shows two upper windows on the yard face at x 852-862 and 902-912 px; the build's yard face carries the kit's door at its middle (x about 907-923 px) and a stable sash and a loft sash toward its north end (x about 997 px), none of them pictured. The 1874 frame stable, not built for 1904: see the material item.
